Z||000000||Vincent Whitright||06-28-99||11:05 PM||||Anyone here see Urban Legend? Well I've got one for you. I've heard about this killer yellow Fiero driving around Columbia,SC. I've a ton of stories about it, but had never seen it. I happened to be out on the railroad tracks tonight and heard this SUPER SWEET sounding car going bye. I looked to my left and saw it. Either an 85 GT, or 85,86 SE. It had the extended wing stands, the factory yellow paint(new looking), massive stickers galore on the body, and what appeared at a distance...a hidden exhaust system, tinted windows, dropped spindles, and what appeared to be enlarged(puffed up) factory side spoilers. Couldn't make out the rims..just that had the low profile tires. IT WAS HOT!!! Now I can let all these people know I've seen it!!!!!! 
